         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Visayan Sea is one of the major traditional fishing grounds in the Philippines and is likewise considered as a top contributor to the country&amp;rsquo;s overall fisheries production</rdf:li>
